  "cells": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        800.9618743781094,
        988.3434852809706,
        154.27011525704813,
        10.519666634738186
      ],
      "text": "Nordstrom, Inc. and subsidiaries 7",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        41.74618167305232,
        851.2769315920398,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "We are continuing our plan to accelerate the number of new Nordstrom Rack store openings. New store openings both at the Rack and in ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        57.45499393358875,
        873.9017242951907,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "our full-line stores involve certain risks, including the availability of suitable locations, constructing, furnishing and supplying a store in a timely ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        73.16380619412507,
        846.6023876451077,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "and cost-effective manner and properly balancing our capital investments between new stores, remodels, technology and ecommerce. In ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        88.8726184546615,
        819.0650572139302,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "addition, we may not accurately assess the demographic or retail environment for a particular location and sales at new, relocated or ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        104.58143071519794,
        847.6053237976782,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "remodeled stores may not meet our projections, particularly in light of the changing trends between online and brick-and-mortar shopping ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        120.29024297573426,
        848.7611090381424,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "channels, which could adversely affect our return on investment. We also intend to open stores in new and international markets, such as ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        135.9990552362707,
        853.8436981757875,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "Canada, Puerto Rico and Manhattan, and expansion will require additional management attention and resources and may distract us from ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        151.70786749680713,
        859.2152251243781,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "executing our core operations. In addition, competition from strong local competitors, compliance with foreign and local laws and regulatory ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        167.41667975734345,
        684.9311774461028,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "requirements and potentially unfavorable tax consequences may cause our business to be adversely impacted.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        194.9071012132822,
        831.2359208126036,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "As we execute our plans and continue to evolve and transform our strategy, we may not adequately manage the related organizational ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        210.61591347381864,
        856.801392620232,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "changes to align with our strategy or appropriately monitor, report or communicate the changes in an effective manner. In addition, we may ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        226.32472573435496,
        801.7268167495854,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "not gather accurate and relevant data or effectively utilize that data, which may impact our strategic planning and decision making.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        251.55040772669224,
        685.5941467661692,
        18.53645083014044
      ],
      "text": "Our stores located in shopping malls may be adversely affected if the consumer traffic of malls decline.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/MQNQGX+ArialNarrow-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        269.52395945083003,
        848.4212271973465,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "Many of our stores are located in desirable locations within shopping malls and benefit from the abilities that we and other anchor tenants ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        285.23277171136647,
        849.5600820895522,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "have to generate consumer traffic. A substantial decline in mall traffic, the development of new shopping malls, the availability of locations ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        300.9415839719029,
        837.5423395522387,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "within existing or new shopping malls, the success of individual shopping malls and the success of other anchor tenants may negatively ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        316.6503962324392,
        840.6020240464345,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "impact our ability to maintain or grow our sales in existing stores, as well as our ability to open new stores, which could have an adverse ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        332.35920849297565,
        341.46266956882255,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "effect on our financial condition or results of operations.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        357.5849297573436,
        809.5460199004974,
        18.536411558109762
      ],
      "text": "Improvements to our merchandise buying processes and systems could adversely affect our business if not successfully ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/MQNQGX+ArialNarrow-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        373.29374201787994,
        68.1803499585406,
        18.536411558109876
      ],
      "text": "executed. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/MQNQGX+ArialNarrow-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        391.2672544699873,
        848.9141281094528,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "We are making investments to improve our merchandise planning, procurement and allocation capabilities through changes in personnel, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        406.9760667305236,
        870.1280244610282,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "processes and technology over a period of several years. If we encounter challenges associated with change management, the ability to hire ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        422.68487899106003,
        852.891791044776,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "and retain key personnel involved in these efforts, implementation of associated information technology or adoption of new processes, our ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        438.39369125159647,
        864.6036654228856,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "ability to continue to successfully execute our strategy or evolve our strategy as the retail environment changes could be adversely affected. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        454.1025035121328,
        842.0128184079601,
        15.028083971903015
      ],
      "text": "As a result, we may not derive the expected benefits to our sales and profitability, or we may incur increased costs relative to our current ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        469.8113157726692,
        82.13598673300163,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "expectations.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        495.03703703703707,
        852.8747757048093,
        18.53641155810982
      ],
      "text": "If we do not effectively design and implement our strategic and business planning processes to attract, retain, train and develop ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/MQNQGX+ArialNarrow-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        510.7458492975735,
        330.77072968490876,
        18.53641155810982
      ],
      "text": "talent and future leaders, our business may suffer",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/MQNQGX+ArialNarrow-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        415.76243781094524,
        513.0105494891443,
        7.7512267827528945,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": ". ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        528.7193617496807,
        865.0796699834161,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "We rely on the experience of our senior management, who have specific knowledge relating to us and our industry that is difficult to replace, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        544.4281740102172,
        808.9510099502486,
        15.028083971902959
      ],
      "text": "and the talents of our workforce to execute our business strategies and objectives. If unexpected turnover occurs without adequate ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        560.1369862707536,
        853.0787558043119,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "succession plans, the loss of the services of any of these individuals, or any resulting negative perceptions of our business, could damage ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        575.8457985312899,
        199.91749585406302,
        15.028083971902959
      ],
      "text": "our reputation and our business.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        601.0715197956578,
        861.4249925373135,
        18.53641155810982
      ],
      "text": "Even if we take appropriate measures to safeguard our information security and privacy environment from security breaches, our ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/MQNQGX+ArialNarrow-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        616.7803320561941,
        388.88805970149247,
        18.53641155810982
      ],
      "text": "customers and our business could still be exposed to risk.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/MQNQGX+ArialNarrow-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        634.7538445083014,
        857.9912935323382,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "Our Retail and Credit segments involve the collection, storage and transmission of customers\u2019 personal information, consumer preferences ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        650.4626567688379,
        873.9696666666666,
        15.028083971902959
      ],
      "text": "and credit card information. In addition, our operations involve the collection, storage and transmission of employee information and company ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        666.1714690293743,
        852.9088063847428,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "financial and strategic data. Any measures we implement to prevent a security or cybersecurity threat may not be totally effective and may ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        681.8802812899106,
        870.70601907131,
        15.028083971902902
      ],
      "text": "have the potential to harm relations with our customers or decrease activity on our websites by making them more difficult to use. In addition, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        697.5890804597701,
        855.8835161691541,
        15.028097062579832
      ],
      "text": "the regulatory environment surrounding information security, cybersecurity and privacy is increasingly demanding, with new and constantly ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        713.2978927203064,
        852.0929199834163,
        15.028097062579832
      ],
      "text": "changing requirements. Security breaches and cyber incidents and their remediation, whether at our company, our third-party providers or ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        729.0067049808429,
        846.7213930348257,
        15.028097062579889
      ],
      "text": "other retailers, could expose us to a risk of loss or misappropriation of this information, litigation, potential liability, reputation damage and ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        744.7155172413793,
        801.471807628524,
        15.028097062579832
      ],
      "text": "loss of customers\u2019 trust and business, which could adversely impact our sales. Any such breaches or incidents could subject us to ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        760.4243295019157,
        860.795951907131,
        15.02809706257986
      ],
      "text": "investigation, notification and remediation costs, and if there is additional information that is later discovered related to such security breach ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        776.133141762452,
        871.0629162520729,
        15.02809706257986
      ],
      "text": "or incident, there could be further loss of customers\u2019 trust and business, based upon their reactions to this additional information. Additionally, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        791.8419540229885,
        633.8171641791043,
        15.028097062579832
      ],
      "text": "as a credit card issuer, we could be subject to credit card fraud losses due to external credit card fraud.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        817.0676883780332,
        735.9262023217248,
        18.53641155810982
      ],
      "text": "If we fail to appropriately manage our capital, we may negatively impact our operations and shareholder return.",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/MQNQGX+ArialNarrow-Bold",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        835.0411877394636,
        835.7914593698176,
        15.028097062579832
      ],
      "text": "We utilize capital to finance our operations, make capital expenditures and acquisitions, manage our debt levels and return value to our ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        850.75,
        861.5438959369817,
        15.02809706257986
      ],
      "text": "shareholders through dividends and share repurchases. If our access to capital is restricted or our borrowing costs increase, our operations ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/ArialNarrow",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        84.99170812603649,
        866.4588122605364,
        853.8777288557214,
        15.028097062579832
      ],
      "text": "and financial condition could be adversely impacted. Further, if we do not properly allocate our capital to maximize returns, our operations, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
